  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Clean Cuts for 3D Print Post‑Processing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Standard diagonal cutters often leave raised marks or stress the surrounding plastic, which may require additional sanding. The flush‑cut blade design cuts closer to the surface, leaving smaller marks and cleaner edges to reduce post‑processing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Smart Lever System & Durable Construction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "An integrated stop lever prevents excessive compression, while the return spring provides smoother, more comfortable operation. Made from durable chrome‑vanadium steel, the cutter includes a protective guard to keep the blade safe and sharp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "For use only on plastic model kits, resin parts, and soft metals (e.g., aluminum). Do not cut hard metals (copper, steel, etc.) or electronic wires."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not twist, pry, or apply lateral force, as this may chip or misalign the blades."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "It is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "After use, clean residue from the blade and store with the blade guard in a dry place to prevent damage or rust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "For long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Clean Cuts for 3D Print Post‑Processing</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Standard diagonal cutters often leave raised marks or stress the surrounding plastic, which may require additional sanding. The flush‑cut blade design cuts closer to the surface, leaving smaller marks and cleaner edges to reduce post‑processing.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/503d0fb56af1438c81fa1a9f47923086/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/503d0fb56af1438c81fa1a9f47923086/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Smart Lever System &amp; Durable Construction</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">An integrated stop lever prevents excessive compression, while the return spring provides smoother, more comfortable operation. Made from durable chrome‑vanadium steel, the cutter includes a protective guard to keep the blade safe and sharp.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f0ecf0b7dbaa4646b2befb6363d49306/2.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f0ecf0b7dbaa4646b2befb6363d49306/2.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 60px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Basic Information</h2>\n<style>\n    .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n        padding: '0 20px'\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList {\n        width: 100%;\n        row-gap: 15px !important;\n        column-gap: 15px !important;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_ic-p {\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n        border-color: #ADADAD;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 640px) {\n        .pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc {\n            padding: 0px !important\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList {\n            width: 100%;\n            row-gap: 15px;\n            column-gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .pct_hardware-tableList .pct_st-tbc .pct_tb .pct_td {\n            height: 50px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\"><!--左列表-->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Blade Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Cr-V Alloy Spring Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Cutting Edge Length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">12 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Overall Length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">130 mm ± 2 mm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右列表-->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 45%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Handle Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Non-slip PVC handle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Blade Design</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Single-bevel blade</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Max Cutting Capacity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">Plastic parts up to 2.5 mm in diameter</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Considerations-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 60px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Considerations</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">For use only on plastic model kits, resin parts, and soft metals (e.g., aluminum). Do not cut hard metals (copper, steel, etc.) or electronic wires.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">Do not twist, pry, or apply lateral force, as this may chip or misalign the blades.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">It is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">After use, clean residue from the blade and store with the blade guard in a dry place to prevent damage or rust.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 15px;\">For long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "Standard diagonal cutters often leave raised marks or stress the surrounding plastic, which may require additional sanding. The flush‑cut blade design cuts closer to the surface, leaving smaller marks and cleaner edges to reduce post‑processing.\n\nAn integrated stop lever prevents excessive compression, while the return spring provides smoother, more comfortable operation. Made from durable chrome‑vanadium steel, the cutter includes a protective guard to keep the blade safe and sharp.\n\nFor use only on plastic model kits, resin parts, and soft metals (e.g., aluminum). Do not cut hard metals (copper, steel, etc.) or electronic wires.\n\nDo not twist, pry, or apply lateral force, as this may chip or misalign the blades.\n\nIt is recommended to wear protective gloves during use, and keep the product away from children and pets.\n\nAfter use, clean residue from the blade and store with the blade guard in a dry place to prevent damage or rust.\n\nFor long-term storage, it is recommended to apply a thin layer of anti-rust oil and store in a dry place to extend service life.",
